  "description": "Code-first gRPC transport binding and strongly-typed client for Orleans.Lattice.Api.Schema. Exposes the schema-management control facade (policy, versioning, remediation and migration, the read-only compliance audit, their accept-then-poll operations, and a fail-closed capability probe) over a remote gRPC surface, with a default-deny authorization interceptor and an unauthenticated auth-scheme discovery RPC.",
